-- Period price rule (user decision 2026-11-01): applies ONLY to local-isp (A, 本地ISP运营商) and pure-native-ip
-- (B, 纯净原生独享 IP). Period total = final monthly price x months x discount, half-year x6 x0.85 (= x51/10),
-- year x12 x0.74 (= x222/25), rounded half-up to whole yuan; monthly prices unchanged.
-- us-local-carrier and residential keep their original Migration 012 prices and are not touched here.
-- Programmatically generated from auth-service/src/payment/pricing.ts; do not hand-edit individual rows. Data-only, no DDL.
